MEMBER 6: FUTURE OF SPACE EXPLORATION

Slide 1: Humans on Mars

- Scientists are planning future human missions to Mars.
- Mars may be explored as a possible place for humans to live.
- Robots are already exploring its surface.
- Many challenges must be solved before humans can live there.

Slide 2: Search for Life Beyond Earth

- Scientists are searching for life on other planets.
- Mars is one important place for research.
- Some moons of Jupiter and Saturn may have underground oceans.
- So far, no life beyond Earth has been confirmed.

Slide 3: Space Tourism and Future Technology

- Space tourism allows people to travel into space.
- Private companies are developing space vehicles.
- Future missions may build bases on the Moon.
- Technology may make space travel more accessible.

Slide 4: Conclusion – The Future Is Beyond Earth

- Space is full of mysteries.
- Every mission teaches us something new.
- Science and technology will help us explore further.
- The future of space exploration is full of possibilities.

